From: gloat <4354076+gloat@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 08:23:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] input: custom accel profile with Quake-style linear curve
 (accel-linear)

`accel-profile "custom"` plus `accel-linear <rate> base=<b> cap=<c>` on touchpad and mouse:
gain = base * (1 + rate * speed), capped at base * cap, speed in device units/ms (libinput
custom profile). Turned into libinput custom-profile points for motion; scrolling keeps the
fallback curve. Needs libinput >= 1.23 (input crate feature libinput_1_23; Cargo.lock unchanged).
